0..74 Comment "// Two composites of substitutions act alike on every term when they agree"
75..148 Comment "// at every index. At an abstraction both composites unfold by conversion"
149..209 Comment "// (`substTwiceUnderLam`; with lifting a definition as well,"
210..286 Comment "// `lift-as-definition`). The lifted step reads a lookup under one binder as"
287..359 Comment "// the weakened lookup (`lookWeakens`), pushes the weakening through the"
360..427 Comment "// lifted substitution (`substWeaken`), and weakens the hypothesis."
429..501 Comment "// The naturals; the syntax; the congruences; the lemmas the lifted step"
502..510 Comment "// uses."
